Third-party components

This repository does not vendor third-party binaries. The following are external
tools that a deployment supplies separately; their own licenses apply and are not
relicensed by this project:

- CodeQL CLI (GitHub) - used to build Java databases during static analysis.
- Ollama / any OpenAI-compatible LLM endpoint - used by the A2 analyst.
- OWASP Benchmark, java-sec-code, RuoYi and other test targets - used only as
  scan subjects. None of their source code is included in this repository.
- Maven, JDK and ysoserial - used when building targets or gadget payloads.

The IAST/RASP agent source under probe-java/ was merged into this repository on
2026-09-14 from a separate local codebase; see probe-java/MANIFEST.md for the
source-fingerprint record. It is distributed under this project's Apache-2.0
license.

Benchmark truth tables under data/ (java_sec_code_truth*.csv, juliet_truth.csv,
ruoyi_451_truth.csv, owasp_shards/shards/mini.json) are derived metadata for
reproducing published measurements, not copies of the target applications.
